WEBVTT

NOTE Version 5 selected-voice illustrated walkthrough; timed to its matching v5 MP4, not the legacy v4 recording.

admin-001
00:00:00.307 --> 00:00:06.531
Welcome to NDH SchoolOS, where your
school’s short link opens its own crest,

admin-002
00:00:06.531 --> 00:00:10.053
motto and colours, for example,
ndhschoolos

admin-003
00:00:10.053 --> 00:00:12.592
dot app, slash s, slash markaz.

admin-004
00:00:13.632 --> 00:00:18.230
Owners use email and password, while staff
and parents use a registered phone number

admin-005
00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:20.256
and four-digit PIN, shared privately.

admin-006
00:00:21.171 --> 00:00:25.283
Save your school branding and short link,
then copy the link for staff and families

admin-007
00:00:25.283 --> 00:00:26.769
to open the right school page.

admin-008
00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:32.910
Tap Install school app for your school’s
crest and name on the home screen, or use

admin-009
00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:35.700
Safari, Share, Add to Home Screen on
iPhone.

admin-010
00:00:36.755 --> 00:00:41.647
Give dual-role teachers one login for My
Class and My Subjects, with only their

admin-011
00:00:41.647 --> 00:00:44.186
assigned home class, Halqah and subjects.

admin-012
00:00:45.224 --> 00:00:49.736
Payroll separates teaching staff from
nannies, security guards, cleaners,

admin-013
00:00:49.736 --> 00:00:53.073
drivers and cooks, without unnecessary
teacher logins.

admin-014
00:00:54.172 --> 00:00:59.216
Conventional schools keep academic terms,
while Islamic or dual-stream schools can

admin-015
00:00:59.216 --> 00:01:03.891
enable Tahfeez, Halqahs, Surah and Ayah
logs, with Mumtaz or Jayyid ratings.

admin-016
00:01:04.951 --> 00:01:09.259
After online sign-in, teachers and
Mu’allims can draft attendance, CA and

admin-017
00:01:09.259 --> 00:01:13.981
exam scores, and memorization offline,
then sync automatically when reconnected.

admin-018
00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:19.621
Report cards stay fixed A4 on phone,
tablet and computer, so check the complete

admin-019
00:01:19.621 --> 00:01:21.534
page and margins before printing.

admin-020
00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:27.639
Before sharing access, test each role,
school-app installation, offline sync and

admin-021
00:01:27.639 --> 00:01:30.960
A4 printing, keeping PINs and school
records private.
